### 2. Spring REST Endpoint

```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/kv")
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class KvCacheController {
    private final CompressionFactory factory;
    private final KvCacheService cacheService;

    @PostMapping("/compress")
    @CircuitBreaker(name = "compression", fallbackMethod = "fallbackCompress")
    public ResponseEntity<Tensor> compress(@RequestBody Tensor kv, @RequestParam int rank) {
        CompressionStrategy strategy = factory.create(StrategyType.LOW_RANK, rank);
        Tensor compressed = strategy.compress(kv);
        cacheService.store(compressed);
        return ResponseEntity.ok(compressed);
    }

    @PostMapping("/decompress")
    public ResponseEntity<Tensor> decompress(@RequestBody Tensor compressed) {
        CompressionStrategy strategy = factory.create(StrategyType.LOW_RANK, 0);
        Tensor kv = strategy.decompress(compressed);
        return ResponseEntity.ok(kv);
    }

    private ResponseEntity<Tensor> fallbackCompress(Tensor kv, int rank, Throwable t) {
        // Graceful degradation: store raw KV
        cacheService.store(kv);
        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE).body(kv);
    }
}
```

